{{Kunark Era}}
'''Cabilis''' (sometimes called New [[Sebilis]]) is the new heart of the [[Iksar]] Empire. The Iksar recaptured the city from the [[Sarnak]] long ago and have since made it their new home. There is an ongoing effort to tame the surrounding areas to ensure the safety of the city.

